<h3>Introduction</h3>

<p>The purpose of this macro is to create a nested list of links
to the documentation for one or more applications hosted at
<a href="https://api.is.keysight.com/cgi-bin/org/of_apps/apiManager/apiManager.cgi">https://api.is.keysight.com</a>
.</p>

<h3>Examples</h3>
Note, all patterns are matched in a case insensitive way.

<h3>Parameters</h3>
<p><strong>Application Name</strong>: This field can either be used to exactly identify the application
to include, or it can be a pattern representing one or more applications to include.  The question mark,
&quot;?&quot, is treated as a wild card for a single character.  The asterisk, &quot;*&quot;, is 
a wild card for any number of characters.  If it starts and ends with a &quot;/&quot, then it
will be treated as a regular expression</p>
<p><strong>Show Collapsed</strong>: By default, the list will be shown as an expanded list where the user
may click on an application name to hide those versions.  If checked, the list will show as collapsed
 by default.
<p><strong>Hide Application Name</strong>: If checked and only one application is identified at 
<a href="https://api.is.keysight.com">https://api.is.keysight.com</a>, then just the versions
of the application will be displayed.
</p>

